      "saves": "Real-world break-even: if adding the bag + seat to Basic lands within roughly the upgrade-to-Main price (often ~$70-$80 round trip domestic on Delta), the regular fare wins outright because it ALSO restores free changes and miles. Buying the regular fare can save the $25 gate-handling penalty (United), the cancellation-fee trap (Delta eCredit minus $99 domestic / $199 long-haul international per person), and the cost of re-booking a non-changeable ticket if plans shift.",
